sdc4:mc-cghpinwzc0wieilpck5f5ekm-shape a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Asset Status: underdevelopment withdrawn states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the underdevelopment withdrawn path of the Asset Status workflow, in order: UnderDevelopment, Withdrawn. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The status of a reusable asset per the W3C Asset Description Metadata Schema: under development, completed, deprecated, withdrawn." ;
