sdc4:mc-htekeop7yycwh1pvay3ik336-shape a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Asset Status: Main path states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the Main path path of the Asset Status workflow, in order: UnderDevelopment, Completed, Deprecated, Withdrawn. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The status of a reusable asset per the W3C Asset Description Metadata Schema: under development, completed, deprecated, withdrawn." ;
